# Build context of the Compose simulator image (BuildKit reads this file instead
# of the root .dockerignore for packages/css/Dockerfile.dev). The same rules,
# except that the committed dev test certificates stay: the host seed puts their
# CA and the SP3 client certificates into the database, so the simulator must
# load the same files. The production images never get them.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
**/seed.config.json
*.log
coverage
.DS_Store
